  "label": "The woman is mapped as 'all these flavors'",
  "description": "The top text 'all these flavors' is mapped onto the visual of the woman eating a popsicle, implying that the woman represents the variety of positive, enjoyable options (symbolized by the popsicle). The popsicle, as a sweet treat, is culturally associated with pleasure and variety, thus the woman is metaphorically mapped as embodying 'all these flavors'.",
